Alembic migrations for the Pipeline_UI backend.

The database URL is resolved at runtime from application settings (env var
PIPELINE_UI_DATABASE_URL). The project standardizes on PostgreSQL; the default
points at the containerized Postgres on localhost:5432. SQLite handling is kept
only for the backend's unit-test fixtures.

Common commands (run from ui/backend, PowerShell-friendly):

    # apply all migrations
    alembic upgrade head

    # show current revision
    alembic current

    # autogenerate a new migration once domain models exist (task 2.x)
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add domain models"

target_metadata is Base.metadata (app.db.base). Import your models so their
tables register on that metadata before autogenerating.
